## fstrcmp (plexinc/plex-home-theater-public)

[Source](https://github.com/plexinc/plex-home-theater-public/blob/f2f1d63f2d48ad0d2935f7002ee1168ebcd5bb3d/xbmc/utils/fstrcmp.c)

Fuzzy string similarity via recursive longest-common-substring. Assertions check symmetry and identity. The tractable variant uses concrete strings.

| Task file | Properties |
|---|---|
| `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_fstrcmp.yml` | unreach-call=true, no-overflow=true, valid-memsafety=true, termination=true |
| `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_fstrcmp_tract.yml` | unreach-call=true, no-overflow=true, termination=true |

