## dehex (visit-vis/VisIt)

[Source](https://github.com/visit-vis/VisIt/blob/141aa46a88ed33742e3ae951c1e2825f9465cce4/third_party_builtin/slivr/teem-1.9.0-src/src/hex/dehex.c)

Hex decoder. Assertions guard nibble range and conversion correctness. The base file has symbolic input (IN_SIZE=16); the tractable variant uses concrete input (IN_SIZE=4), making unreach-call and termination provable.

| Task file | Properties |
|---|---|
| `visit-vis_VisIt_dehex.yml` | valid-memsafety=true, termination=true |
| `visit-vis_VisIt_dehex_tract.yml` | unreach-call=true, termination=true |

Note: unreach-call is only in the `_tract` variant; the base times out on both termination and unreach-call at IN_SIZE=16.

---

