## matrix (visit-vis/VisIt)

[Source](https://github.com/visit-vis/VisIt/blob/141aa46a88ed33742e3ae951c1e2825f9465cce4/plots/Molecule/matrix.c)

4×4 LU decomposition, matrix inversion (`_inv`), and affine point transform (`_mult`). Uses single-precision floats. unreach-call is in a separate `_mult_unreach` task file using a dedicated harness.

| Task file | Properties |
|---|---|
| `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_inv.yml` | valid-memsafety=true, no-overflow=true, termination=true |
| `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_mult.yml` | valid-memsafety=true, no-overflow=true, termination=true |
| `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_mult_unreach.yml` | unreach-call=true |

