## SV-COMP Category Mapping

Suggested category membership when adding to the sv-benchmarks repository. Each task file is listed under the category matching its actual properties.

### ReachSafety (unreach-call)

| Category | Task files |
|---|---|
| `ReachSafety-Arrays` | `antirez_redis_strl`, `antirez_redis_strl_tract`, `natsteven_sorts_bub`, `natsteven_sorts_bub_tract`, `natsteven_sorts_ins`, `natsteven_sorts_ins_tract`, `natsteven_sorts_mer`, `natsteven_sorts_mer_tract`, `natsteven_sorts_sel`, `natsteven_sorts_sel_tract`, `natsteven_sorts_unsort`, `visit-vis_VisIt_dehex_tract`, `visit-vis_VisIt_enhex_tract` |
| `ReachSafety-Arrays` (expected false) | `DrKLO_Telegram_superfasthash_unreach`, `antirez_redis_localtime_unsafe_unreach`, `antirez_redis_localtime_unsafe_tract_unreach` |
| `ReachSafety-BitVectors` | `antirez_redis_endianconv`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_unreach_ll`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_unreach_ull`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_unreach_r1`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_unreach_r2`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_unreach_r3`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_rand_r` |
| `ReachSafety-Floats` | `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_mult_unreach` |
| `ReachSafety-Heap` | `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_getdelim` |
| `ReachSafety-Recursive` | `antirez_redis_fastjson_tract`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_fstrcmp`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_fstrcmp_tract`, `natsteven_sorts_mer`, `natsteven_sorts_mer_tract` |
| `ReachSafety-Integers` | `antirez_redis_localtime`, `antirez_redis_localtime_tract` |

### NoOverflows (no-overflow)

| Category | Task files |
|---|---|
| `NoOverflows-BitVectors` | `antirez_redis_mt19937-64`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_array`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_rand_r` |
| `NoOverflows-BitVectors` (expected false) | `DrKLO_Telegram_superfasthash` |
| `NoOverflows-Other` | `antirez_redis_fastjson`, `antirez_redis_fastjson_tract`, `antirez_redis_localtime`, `antirez_redis_localtime_tract`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_fstrcmp`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_fstrcmp_tract`, `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_inv`, `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_mult` |
| `NoOverflows-Other` (expected false) | `antirez_redis_localtime_unsafe`, `antirez_redis_localtime_unsafe_tract` |

### MemSafety (valid-memsafety)

| Category | Task files |
|---|---|
| `MemSafety-Arrays` | `DrKLO_Telegram_superfasthash_tract`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_array`, `antirez_redis_mt19937-64_array_valid-memsafety_tract`, `antirez_redis_strl`, `natsteven_sorts_bub`, `natsteven_sorts_ins`, `natsteven_sorts_mer`, `natsteven_sorts_sel`, `natsteven_sorts_unsort`, `visit-vis_VisIt_dehex`, `visit-vis_VisIt_enhex`, `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_inv`, `visit-vis_VisIt_matrix_mult` |
| `MemSafety-Heap` | `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_getdelim`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_getdelim_tract`, `plexinc_plex-home-theater-public_fstrcmp` |
